## 03. A Memorable Milestone

### Delivering the Closing Speech

One of the most meaningful moments of my summer school
experience was being given the opportunity to deliver
the closing speech.

Speaking in front of an audience challenged me to organise
my thoughts, communicate my message clearly, and present
my reflections in an international learning environment.

The experience reminded me that effective communication
involves more than speaking. It also requires preparation,
clear organisation, and an understanding of how to convey
ideas to an audience.

I am grateful for this opportunity because it encouraged
me to step outside my comfort zone and recognise the
importance of communication skills alongside academic
knowledge and technical abilities.

