## 05. Reflection

### Learning Beyond the Classroom

Looking back, the summer school at Hebei University was a
valuable experience that combined academic exploration,
cultural discovery, and personal growth.

The academic sessions broadened my exposure to data, AI,
finance, and digital transformation, while the cultural
activities helped me appreciate the richness of Chinese
traditions. Delivering the closing speech was another
important milestone that strengthened my awareness of the
value of communication and stepping outside my comfort zone.

As a Data Analytics student, I believe that learning extends
beyond technical skills. It also involves understanding
different contexts, communicating ideas effectively,
collaborating with people from diverse backgrounds, and
remaining open to new knowledge.

This experience encouraged me to continue developing both
my technical and interpersonal skills as I prepare for
future academic and professional opportunities.

